# Document types

Reports are `investigation_report`, `design_verification`,
`mechanical_design_verification`, `quality_risk_assessment`, or
`generic_document` (demo and Convergent packs). The registry is
`src/lib/document-types/`. Call `getDocumentType(type)` for sections, criteria,
prompts, chat persona, and merge.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — assumes every report is DMAIC
const sections = ["define", "measure", "analyze", "improve", "control"];

// ✅ GOOD
const sections = getWorkspaceSections(report.documentType);
```

- Investigation criteria still live in `src/lib/ai/criteria.ts`, but they are
  **exposed through the registry**. DV criteria (LLM + deterministic checks)
  live under `src/lib/document-types/design-verification/`.
- Eval cache hash salts with `getDocumentType(type).prompts.promptVersion`
  (`PROMPT_VERSION` for investigation, `dv-checklist-v1` for demo DV,
  `convergent-dv-v7` for Convergent DV).
- Chat editable sections: `chatEditableSections(documentType)` in
  `src/lib/ai/chat/fields.ts`. Do not reuse investigation field maps on DV.
- Criteria evaluation is per filled section. An empty Purpose / Define /
  cover page must not block Run criteria on other sections that have
  content. Cover page eval reads `reports.metadata` (document number),
  not a `report_sections` body.
- Adding a type: extend `documentTypeEnum` in schema, add a definition, wire
  `getDocumentType()`, then editors / chat / eval. DOCX export uses each type's
  `export.templatePath` and `buildTemplateData` (investigation still has an
  explicit DMAIC branch in `generate-docx.ts`; generic documents use
  `templates/generic-document-template.docx`).
- `generic_document` is demo and Convergent: one `body` section, `evaluation.kind === "none"`
  (hide Criteria / Run AI Check), headings enabled, Word import is type-owned
  (`wordImport.kind === "generic_body"` — do **not** set pack `wordImportEnabled`
  on demo or Convergent for this), and accepting AI suggestions uses `suggestionApplyMode: "tracked_change"`
  (pending insert/delete marks persist and export as Word tracked changes).
  The editor is one TipTap field laid out as Letter pages (`PagedDocumentSurface`);
  do not persist page-break nodes.
